WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:10.248
The texture of the hanbok fabric isn't just a matter of taste — it's a key factor in your complexion.

2
00:00:10.584 --> 00:00:20.280
If you're cool-toned with a blue undertone, a fabric with a subtle sheen, like silk, acts like a reflector, making your skin look brighter and more refined.

3
00:00:20.616 --> 00:00:26.784
The shine maximizes the sleek image cool tones naturally have and visually softens fine lines.

4
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:36.168
For warm-toned parents with yellow undertones, a calm matte or softly textured fabric feels far more stable and elegant than a highly glossy one.

5
00:00:36.504 --> 00:00:43.368
In fact, if warm-toned skin wears something overly glossy, the face can look puffy or blemishes can stand out, so be careful.

6
00:00:43.704 --> 00:00:53.136
Matching fabric texture to your personal color diagnosis creates the best synergy — the deciding difference in looking ten years younger.
